  "initialKey": 0,
  "messages": [
    {
      "displayText": "¡¿Hoo?!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 0,
      "offsetInSection": 628,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A100BF0048006F006F003F00210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 8
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¿Qué ocurre, Hoopa? ¿Te ha llamado la atención\nalgo que lleva <U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000>?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƥ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 644,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00BF0051007500E90020006F00630075007200720065002C00200048006F006F00700061003F002000BF005400650020006800610020006C006C0061006D00610064006F0020006C00610020006100740065006E0063006900F3006E000A0061006C0067006F00200071007500650020006C006C00650076006100200010000201000000003F00100002011401A50000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 72
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Anda, ¿eso son... caramelos?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƥ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 788,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0041006E00640061002C002000BF00650073006F00200073006F006E002E002E002E00200063006100720061006D0065006C006F0073003F00100002011401A50000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 33
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Caramelos Chispeantes",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 856,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0043006100720061006D0065006C006F007300200043006800690073007000650061006E0074006500730000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 22
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¿Quieres probar?",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 900,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00BF0051007500690065007200650073002000700072006F006200610072003F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 17
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Me da un poco de miedo eso de que estallen en\nla boca, pero, si los pruebo, quizá pueda aprender<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nalgo nuevo que aplicar a los dónuts.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƥ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 936,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 141
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Vale, me armaré de valor y los probaré.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƥ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 1220,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00560061006C0065002C0020006D0065002000610072006D0061007200E9002000640065002000760061006C006F0072002000790020006C006F0073002000700072006F00620061007200E9002E00100002011401A50000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 44
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Halaaa!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƥ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 1308,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A100480061006C006100610061002100100002011401A50000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 13
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Creo que me han inspirado para crear una nueva\nclase de dónut!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƥ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 1336,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A1004300720065006F00200071007500650020006D0065002000680061006E00200069006E007300700069007200610064006F0020007000610072006100200063007200650061007200200075006E00610020006E0075006500760061000A0063006C0061007300650020006400650020006400F3006E00750074002100100002011401A50000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 68
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Espera un momento, <U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000>.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƥ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 1472,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00450073007000650072006100200075006E0020006D006F006D0065006E0074006F002C00200010000201000000002E00100002011401A50000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 29
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Ya está! Acabo de inventarme una nueva receta.\nSería un dónut con estos valores...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƥ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 1532,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 88
    },
    {
      "displayText": "40 o más de dulce, 200 o más de picante,\n400 o más de agrio, 280 o más de amargo<U+0010><U+0001>븀\ny 40 o más de fresco.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƥ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 1708,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 110
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Avísame cuando tengas los ingredientes y lo\npreparo!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƥ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 1928,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A10041007600ED00730061006D00650020006300750061006E0064006F002000740065006E0067006100730020006C006F007300200069006E006700720065006400690065006E007400650073002000790020006C006F000A007000720065007000610072006F002100100002011401A50000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 58
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+000D>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 2044,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF000D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "He conseguido preparar un <U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0006>Glaseado de Plasma<U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0000>,\ny todo gracias a la inspiración que me vino tras<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nprobar los Caramelos Chispeantes.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƥ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 10,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 2056,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 144
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Me pregunto a dónde llevará el portal que abra\nHoopa con este dónut.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƥ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 2344,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004D0065002000700072006500670075006E0074006F002000610020006400F3006E006400650020006C006C006500760061007200E100200065006C00200070006F007200740061006C002000710075006500200061006200720061000A0048006F006F0070006100200063006F006E002000650073007400650020006400F3006E00750074002E00100002011401A50000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 73
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡<U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000>!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 6,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 2492,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A10010000201000000002100100002011400080000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 11
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Necesito que te presentes en la <U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0006>Estación<U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0000>\n<U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0006>Luminalia Sur<U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0000> cuanto antes!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 15,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 2516,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 90
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Miedo me da pensar en qué ha sucedido.\nPero, si alguien puede solucionarlo, es<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿāea eres tú.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƥ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 2696,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 99
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0013>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 19,
      "offsetInSection": 2896,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00130000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Mira.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 20,
      "offsetInSection": 2908,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004D006900720061002E00100002011400080000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 10
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Es una distorsión que ni tú has visto hasta ahora,\n¿me equivoco?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 21,
      "offsetInSection": 2928,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0045007300200075006E006100200064006900730074006F00720073006900F3006E00200071007500650020006E00690020007400FA002000680061007300200076006900730074006F002000680061007300740061002000610068006F00720061002C000A00BF006D0065002000650071007500690076006F0063006F003F00100002011400080000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 69
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Cierto, es la primera vez",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 22,
      "offsetInSection": 3068,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00430069006500720074006F002C0020006500730020006C00610020007000720069006D006500720061002000760065007A0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 26
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Curioso el color amarillo",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 23,
      "offsetInSection": 3120,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0043007500720069006F0073006F00200065006C00200063006F006C006F007200200061006D006100720069006C006C006F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 26
    },
    {
      "displayText": "No tengo la menor idea de qué Pokémon puede\nhaber al otro lado. Por eso te he llamado.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 24,
      "offsetInSection": 3172,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 91
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Hola! ¿Te puedo pedir una cosa? Gracias.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0013>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 25,
      "offsetInSection": 3356,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A10048006F006C00610021002000BF0054006500200070007500650064006F00200070006500640069007200200075006E006100200063006F00730061003F00200047007200610063006900610073002E00100002011400130000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 46
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Hemos detectado una distorsión potentísima!<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nFijo que al otro lado hay un Pokémon de armas\ntomar y, como se descontrole, se va a liar pero<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nbien gorda.<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n¡Una misión perfecta para mi trío maravillas\nfavorito!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0013>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 9,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 26,
      "offsetInSection": 3448,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 219
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Me encargaré de informar a doña Megapiedras y\na vuestr<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿāao líder.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0013>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 27,
      "offsetInSection": 3888,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004D006500200065006E00630061007200670061007200E900200064006500200069006E0066006F0072006D006100720020006100200064006F00F100610020004D006500670061007000690065006400720061007300200079000A0061002000760075006500730074007200100003110000FF01010061006F0020006C00ED006400650072002E00100002011400130000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 73
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Tenéis que dirigiros a la <U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0006>Estación Luminalia Sur<U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0000>.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0013>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 9,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 28,
      "offsetInSection": 4036,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00540065006E00E900690073002000710075006500200064006900720069006700690072006F0073002000610020006C0061002000100002FF00000600450073007400610063006900F3006E0020004C0075006D0069006E0061006C00690061002000530075007200100002FF000000002E00100002011400130000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 62
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Ya estoy ahí",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 29,
      "offsetInSection": 4160,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "005900610020006500730074006F007900200061006800ED0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 13
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Estoy viendo la distorsión",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 30,
      "offsetInSection": 4188,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004500730074006F00790020007600690065006E0064006F0020006C006100200064006900730074006F00720073006900F3006E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 27
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Eres una caja de sorpresas. Muy bien, en tal caso,\nya sabes lo que tienes que hacer.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0013>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 31,
      "offsetInSection": 4244,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 89
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Si te soy sincera, a ese tipo le vendría que ni\npintado el puesto de alcalde.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 32,
      "offsetInSection": 4424,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 82
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡A darlo todo!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƒ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 33,
      "offsetInSection": 4588,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A100410020006400610072006C006F00200074006F0064006F002100100002011401920000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 19
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>봆<U+0000>¡Buenas, <U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000>! Me temo que\n<U+0010><U+0002>Ƌ<U+0001><U+0010><U+0001>븀\nva<U+0010><U+0001>븀\na<U+0010><U+0001>븀\ntardar<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nen<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nvenir.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƒ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 21,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 34,
      "offsetInSection": 4628,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 77
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Así que no nos queda otra que encargarnos\nnosotr<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿāoas dos de esta tarea.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƒ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 35,
      "offsetInSection": 4784,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 80
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Corelia, si queréis, yo podría reemplazar a vuestr<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿāao\nlíder esta vez y echaros una mano.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 36,
      "offsetInSection": 4944,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 97
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Anda! Tú eras... Matière, ¿verdad?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƒ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 37,
      "offsetInSection": 5140,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A10041006E0064006100210020005400FA00200065007200610073002E002E002E0020004D00610074006900E800720065002C002000BF007600650072006400610064003F00100002011401920000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 40
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Sí, nos conocimos en Luminalia Dimensional,\njusto antes de la Operación Megadónut.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 38,
      "offsetInSection": 5220,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 87
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Recuerdo que tú también sabes usar muy bien\nla megaevolución.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƒ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 39,
      "offsetInSection": 5396,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0052006500630075006500720064006F00200071007500650020007400FA002000740061006D0062006900E9006E002000730061006200650073002000750073006100720020006D007500790020006200690065006E000A006C00610020006D00650067006100650076006F006C00750063006900F3006E002E00100002011401920000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 66
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Decidido! ¡Nos encargaremos nosotr<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿāoas tres\nde esta misión!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƒ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 40,
      "offsetInSection": 5528,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A10044006500630069006400690064006F0021002000A1004E006F007300200065006E0063006100720067006100720065006D006F00730020006E006F0073006F0074007200100003110000FF0101006F0061007300200074007200650073000A00640065002000650073007400610020006D00690073006900F3006E002100100002011401920000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 69
    },
    {
      "displayText": "En cuanto estés list<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿāoa, <U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000>, avísanos.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 8,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 41,
      "offsetInSection": 5668,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0045006E0020006300750061006E0074006F002000650073007400E900730020006C00690073007400100003110000FF0101006F0061002C00200010000201000000002C00200061007600ED00730061006E006F0073002E00100002011400080000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 49
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿*",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 42,
      "offsetInSection": 5768,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF002A0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¿Entramos?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƒ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 43,
      "offsetInSection": 5780,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00BF0045006E007400720061006D006F0073003F00100002011401920000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 15
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Adelante!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 44,
      "offsetInSection": 5812,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A1004100640065006C0061006E0074006500210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 11
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Me tengo que preparar",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 45,
      "offsetInSection": 5836,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004D0065002000740065006E0067006F00200071007500650020007000720065007000610072006100720000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 22
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Es la primera vez que vamos a trabajar l<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿāoas tres\njunt<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿāoas, así que será mejor que te prepares bien.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƒ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 6,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 46,
      "offsetInSection": 5880,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 113
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Yo estoy lista cuando queráis. ¡Debemos proteger\nla paz en Ciudad Luminalia!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 47,
      "offsetInSection": 6108,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 81
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Espera, <U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000>!<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nAsegúrate de tener algún hueco en tus cajas,\nque tenemos que atrapar al Pokémon.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 8,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 48,
      "offsetInSection": 6272,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 103
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Para abrir una distorsión especial, necesitas\nun dónut igual de especial; para eso no me hace<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nfalta ser detective.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 49,
      "offsetInSection": 6480,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 122
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿2",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 50,
      "offsetInSection": 6724,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00320000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡¿Zeraora?!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƒ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 51,
      "offsetInSection": 6736,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A100BF005A006500720061006F00720061003F002100100002011401920000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 16
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Es un Pokémon de tipo Eléctrico muy poderoso.\nNo sé cómo vamos a vencerlo si se descontrola...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƒ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 52,
      "offsetInSection": 6768,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 99
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Vaya, ¿incluso le inspira temor a una Entrenadora\nde tu nivel?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 53,
      "offsetInSection": 6968,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0056006100790061002C002000BF0069006E0063006C00750073006F0020006C006500200069006E00730070006900720061002000740065006D006F00720020006100200075006E006100200045006E007400720065006E00610064006F00720061000A006400650020007400750020006E006900760065006C003F00100002011400080000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 67
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡No es eso!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƒ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 54,
      "offsetInSection": 7104,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A1004E006F002000650073002000650073006F002100100002011401920000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 16
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Lo que tengo es ilusión por poder enfrentarme a\nun rival tan fuerte!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƒ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 55,
      "offsetInSection": 7136,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A1004C006F0020007100750065002000740065006E0067006F00200065007300200069006C00750073006900F3006E00200070006F007200200070006F00640065007200200065006E006600720065006E007400610072006D006500200061000A0075006E00200072006900760061006C002000740061006E0020006600750065007200740065002100100002011401920000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 74
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Venga, tenemos que librarlo del sufrimiento de\nla megaevolución descontrolada.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƒ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 56,
      "offsetInSection": 7284,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 83
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Detectado un rápido aumento en los niveles\nde megapoder en la zona.<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n¡Alerta! ¡El espécimen identificado está a punto\nde sufrir una megaevolución descontrolada!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 57,
      "offsetInSection": 7452,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 163
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿:",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 58,
      "offsetInSection": 7780,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF003A0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Zeraaa!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 59,
      "offsetInSection": 7792,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A1005A0065007200610061006100210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 9
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000>, ¡atrapa a Zeraora!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƒ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 60,
      "offsetInSection": 7812,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0010000201000000002C002000A1006100740072006100700061002000610020005A006500720061006F00720061002100100002011401920000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 29
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Uf, impresionante la fuerza de Zeraora.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƒ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 61,
      "offsetInSection": 7872,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00550066002C00200069006D00700072006500730069006F006E0061006E007400650020006C006100200066007500650072007A00610020006400650020005A006500720061006F00720061002E00100002011401920000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 44
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Se dice que Zeraora a veces aparece en ciudades\nen busca de oponentes, e incluso que en alguna<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nque otra ocasión hace de guardaespaldas.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 62,
      "offsetInSection": 7960,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 143
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Puede que fueran sus ganas de combatir las que\ncrearan este lugar.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƒ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 63,
      "offsetInSection": 8248,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "005000750065006400650020007100750065002000660075006500720061006E0020007300750073002000670061006E0061007300200064006500200063006F006D006200610074006900720020006C006100730020007100750065000A006300720065006100720061006E002000650073007400650020006C0075006700610072002E00100002011401920000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 71
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Bueno, volvamos a Ciudad Luminalia.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 64,
      "offsetInSection": 8392,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004200750065006E006F002C00200076006F006C00760061006D006F00730020006100200043006900750064006100640020004C0075006D0069006E0061006C00690061002E00100002011400080000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 40
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿A",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 65,
      "offsetInSection": 8472,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00410000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Después de esta experiencia, aprecio aún más\ntodo lo que habéis hecho para proteger la ciudad.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 66,
      "offsetInSection": 8484,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 99
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Os estoy muy agradecida a l<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿāoas dos.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 67,
      "offsetInSection": 8684,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004F00730020006500730074006F00790020006D0075007900200061006700720061006400650063006900640061002000610020006C00100003110000FF0101006F0061007300200064006F0073002E00100002011400080000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 45
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Gracias a ti también. Sin tu ayuda, no creo que\nhubiéramos sido capaces de calmar a Zeraora.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƒ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 68,
      "offsetInSection": 8776,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 97
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Ya estoy aquí!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0006>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 69,
      "offsetInSection": 8972,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A1005900610020006500730074006F0079002000610071007500ED002100100002011400060000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 20
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Ya estoy aquí!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0005>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 70,
      "offsetInSection": 9012,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A1005900610020006500730074006F0079002000610071007500ED002100100002011400050000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 20
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Eh... Ya nos hemos encargado nosotr<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿāoas.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƒ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 71,
      "offsetInSection": 9052,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00450068002E002E002E0020005900610020006E006F0073002000680065006D006F007300200065006E006300610072006700610064006F0020006E006F0073006F0074007200100003110000FF0101006F00610073002E00100002011401920000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 49
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¿Cómo dices? ¿Matière se ha apuntado también?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0006>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 72,
      "offsetInSection": 9152,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00BF004300F3006D006F002000640069006300650073003F002000BF004D00610074006900E8007200650020007300650020006800610020006100700075006E007400610064006F002000740061006D0062006900E9006E003F00100002011400060000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 50
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¿Cómo dices? ¿Matière se ha apuntado también?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0005>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 73,
      "offsetInSection": 9252,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00BF004300F3006D006F002000640069006300650073003F002000BF004D00610074006900E8007200650020007300650020006800610020006100700075006E007400610064006F002000740061006D0062006900E9006E003F00100002011400050000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 50
    },
    {
      "displayText": "He hecho lo que he podido para reemplazarte.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 74,
      "offsetInSection": 9352,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0048006500200068006500630068006F0020006C006F002000710075006500200068006500200070006F006400690064006F002000700061007200610020007200650065006D0070006C0061007A0061007200740065002E00100002011400080000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 49
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Se podría decir que somos el nuevo trío más\npoderoso de toda Ciudad Luminalia!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƒ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 75,
      "offsetInSection": 9452,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 84
    },
    {
